  Severity: DiagnosticSeverity_Warning
  Code: <none>
  Message:
    THE JOIN here is the lifecycle position, not `JOIN`.

    This program also defines a value spelled JOIN, which THE JOIN does
    not reach: after THE, JOIN always names the join of the obligation
    this is written under (or of the one it is handed to). Before 2026-10-24
    that THE was an optional article in front of a name, so a program written
    then may have meant its own value.

    To pass that value, write JOIN without THE. To keep THE JOIN and
    silence this warning, rename the value.

